{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-sub-lime","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Sub Lime","description":"\u003cp\u003eSub Lime S:ALT by Riot Squad - A subversive flavours of sweet acidic lime and lemon, that will mess up your senses and leave you with a sour aftertaste.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNic Salts are extracted directly from the natural tobacco leaf versus traditionally being made using a form of artificial nicotine called 'free base'. This range from Riot Squad is a hybrid version, using 50% freebase nicotine and 50% salt nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41670482427959,"sku":"69d25e5ee3fbb","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41670482460727,"sku":"69d25e5f88464","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/riot-salt-sub-lime-vape-juice.jpg?v=1747700484","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/riot-squad-salts-sub-lime","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




